--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 11 | Text: 男人想发财必须得过清官
Segment #2   [00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,240] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 16 | Text: 一个过不了清官的男人是一辈子赚不到钱的
Segment #3   [00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:07,660] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 17 | Text: 我记得我看我以前讲他跟邓立军谈恋爱的时候
Segment #4   [00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:11,160] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 13 | Text: 当时的邓立军是全球第一大美女
Segment #5   [00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,000] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是什么感觉
Segment #6   [00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,760] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 12 | Text: 我靠你影响了我的视野困难吗
Segment #7   [00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:14,380] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 不应谈了
Segment #8   [00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,140] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 14 | Text: 然后我记得大家有没有看过大话戏有的
Segment #9   [00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:20,880] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 16 | Text: 那个当时自尊宝戴上金窟的那一颗说的
Segment #10  [00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:24,000] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 12 | Text: 我戴上金窟化身成七天大圣
Segment #11  [00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,020] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 6  | Text: 我就没办法报你
Segment #12  [00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,980] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是呢我如果说是自尊宝
Segment #13  [00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,680] | Elapsed:  15.45s | Words: 9  | Text: 我就没办法给你你想的生活
Segment #14  [00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,540] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 5  | Text: 我也保护不了你
Segment #15  [00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,720] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 12 | Text: 于是呢我只能去选择为事业
Segment #16  [00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,440] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 11 | Text: 为理想去做一个奋斗的男人
Segment #17  [00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,580] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后我刚才我看电影看什么
Segment #18  [00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,760] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 10 | Text: 看李连杰演的那个张三峰
Segment #19  [00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,500] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 8  | Text: 里边有个叫天宝的
Segment #20  [00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,020] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 6  | Text: 他在一个军营里
Segment #21  [00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,800] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后一个一个大坏蛋
Segment #22  [00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,300] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 13 | Text: 说你怎么能把这个女人带到军营里
Segment #23  [00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,820] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 10 | Text: 妈的这个他很爱这个女人的
Segment #24  [00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,260] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 9  | Text: 他怕一掌给他劈死了
Segment #25  [00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,200] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以说我想表达的意思是什么
Segment #26  [00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:55,100] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是爱情情感这个东西
Segment #27  [00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:55,920] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 5  | Text: 是在现在这个时候
Segment #28  [00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:56,760] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 5  | Text: 它是很虚的
Segment #29  [00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,100] | Elapsed:  32.99s | Words: 7  | Text: 人都会都会变的
Segment #30  [00:00:58,460 --> 00:01:00,140] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 10 | Text: 无论两人在一起感情多好
Segment #31  [00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:01,220] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 你多爱我我多爱他
Segment #32  [00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,600] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 终究有一刻都是会变的
Segment #33  [00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,240] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是唯独只有一样东西
Segment #34  [00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:06,500] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 是一辈子不会变的
Segment #35  [00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,520] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是到你独立的钱
Segment #36  [00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,300] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 所以说一个男人他必须
Segment #37  [00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:10,620] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 你只有事业和工作
Segment #38  [00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:12,160] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不能有修漂亮的爱情
Segment #39  [00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,440] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 聊爱情是很脆弱的
Segment #40  [00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:15,840] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 千万不要有这种想法
Segment #41  [00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,520] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 所以说人要想挣钱
Segment #42  [00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,860] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 必须得过情完
Segment #43  [00:01:18,860 --> 00:01:20,400] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 4  | Text: 你看我很小的时候
Segment #44  [00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:22,740] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 9  | Text: 我那时候还弹过一个女朋友
Segment #45  [00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:23,400] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 4  | Text: 我也很爱她
Segment #46  [00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:24,040] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 5  | Text: 她也很爱我
Segment #47  [00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:26,620] | Elapsed:  50.86s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是由于我们两个人的性格
Segment #48  [00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:28,180] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 不是很合适
Segment #49  [00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:30,420] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后我们每次就会懂吵架
Segment #50  [00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:31,320] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 懂吵架一吵架
Segment #51  [00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:32,500] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 那就影响我的状态
Segment #52  [00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:33,180] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就很内耗
Segment #53  [00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,600] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 后来我想不行
Segment #54  [00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:38,000] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 在道有爱情之间
Segment #55  [00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,720] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 我选择道一
Segment #56  [00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,500] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 是在事业与爱情之间
Segment #57  [00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:42,700] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 我选择事业
Segment #58  [00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:45,180] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 其实很多年以后回我头来看
Segment #59  [00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:47,860] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 11 | Text: 我感觉我的每一个选择都是对的
Segment #60  [00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:48,800] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 2  | Text: 尽管
Segment #61  [00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,260] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 3  | Text: 有些时候
Segment #62  [00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:52,820] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 夜深人静的时候
Segment #63  [00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:54,480] | Elapsed:  66.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 心里会难过
Segment #64  [00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,000] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 也会偶尔想起他
Segment #65  [00:01:56,460 --> 00:01:58,040] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是看到我卡里的钱的时候
Segment #66  [00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,560] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 我觉得一切的付出
Segment #67  [00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:01,760] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 2  | Text: 就是人
Segment #68  [00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:04,940] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 你得到什么就会失去什么
Segment #69  [00:02:04,940 --> 00:02:06,440] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不可能所有的东西都是
Segment #70  [00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:08,500] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 失去人失眉的
Segment #71  [00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:09,820] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 但我觉得还是钱
Segment #72  [00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,320] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 我们每一个人活在这个世界上
Segment #73  [00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:12,960] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 都是为了钱
Segment #74  [00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:15,000] | Elapsed:  77.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 在我们身上祝你们越来越好
